# --- Generated output (regenerable; may contain secrets) --------------------
# out/ holds rendered papers AND a plaintext codebook.json from the crude CLI
# path. Codebooks are secrets (CLAUDE.md, security rules): never commit them.
out/
eval/out/
models/
*.pdf
# Test fixtures are data, not output.
!tests/**/*.pdf

# Secrets and raw leaks
codebook.json
/leak.txt
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
*.pem

